      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The spectrum-level splitting of BPGL<1> cooperations at all primes over C, R and finite fields is constructed without motivic Brown-Gitler spectra, using a relative motivic Adams spectral sequence, a motivic Margolis Whitehead theorem and integral Brown-Gitler comodule calculations to produce actual Adams-cover summands. All original field/characteristic and p-completion hypotheses, maps, charts and source-local obstructions are retained. Homotopy-level, n=0 and E1-page companion statements are context, not additional counts.",
